### Lab 1 – Loan Approval: HTTP Requests (VS Code REST Client / IntelliJ HTTP Client)

@workerUrl = http://localhost:8092
@mockApiUrl = http://localhost:8088

### ===== DEPLOY =====

### Deploy BPMN + DMN
POST {{workerUrl}}/workflow/deploy

### ===== TOPOLOGY =====

### Zeebe Connection Check
GET {{workerUrl}}/workflow/topology

### ===== TC-L1-01: APPROVED =====

### Eligible Applicant – Expected: APPROVED
POST {{workerUrl}}/workflow/start
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "applicantId": "SYN-APP-001-PASS",
  "applicantName": "Alice Johnson",
  "age": 35,
  "employmentStatus": "EMPLOYED",
  "requestedAmount": 10000,
  "monthlyIncome": 5000,
  "existingMonthlyDebt": 800,
  "loanTermMonths": 60
}

### ===== TC-L1-02: REJECTED =====

### Ineligible Applicant – Expected: REJECTED
POST {{workerUrl}}/workflow/start
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "applicantId": "SYN-APP-002-FAIL",
  "applicantName": "Bob Smith",
  "age": 25,
  "employmentStatus": "UNEMPLOYED",
  "requestedAmount": 25000,
  "monthlyIncome": 1200,
  "existingMonthlyDebt": 700,
  "loanTermMonths": 60
}

### ===== TC-L1-03: MANUAL REVIEW =====

### Borderline Applicant – Expected: MANUAL_REVIEW (User Task in Tasklist)
POST {{workerUrl}}/workflow/start
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "applicantId": "SYN-APP-003-MANUAL",
  "applicantName": "Carol Davis",
  "age": 42,
  "employmentStatus": "SELF_EMPLOYED",
  "requestedAmount": 30000,
  "monthlyIncome": 4000,
  "existingMonthlyDebt": 1200,
  "loanTermMonths": 48
}

### ===== CREDIT API DIRECT CALL =====

### Direct credit assessment (bypasses process)
POST {{mockApiUrl}}/credit/assess
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "applicantId": "SYN-APP-DIRECT-001",
  "requestedAmount": 10000,
  "monthlyIncome": 4000,
  "employmentStatus": "EMPLOYED"
}

### ===== FAILURE INJECTION =====

### Enable API failure mode
POST {{mockApiUrl}}/admin/failure-mode
Content-Type: application/json

{"enabled": true}

### Disable API failure mode
POST {{mockApiUrl}}/admin/failure-mode
Content-Type: application/json

{"enabled": false}

### Enable timeout simulation (10 seconds)
POST {{mockApiUrl}}/admin/timeout-mode
Content-Type: application/json

{"enabled": true, "delaySeconds": 10}

### Disable timeout simulation
POST {{mockApiUrl}}/admin/timeout-mode
Content-Type: application/json

{"enabled": false}

### Enable worker failure mode
POST {{workerUrl}}/worker-config/failure-mode
Content-Type: application/json

{"enabled": true}

### Disable worker failure mode
POST {{workerUrl}}/worker-config/failure-mode
Content-Type: application/json

{"enabled": false}

### ===== STATUS =====

### Mock API health
GET {{mockApiUrl}}/health

### Mock API admin status
GET {{mockApiUrl}}/admin/status

### Worker config status
GET {{workerUrl}}/worker-config/status

### Worker actuator health
GET {{workerUrl}}/actuator/health

